+---
+status: in-progress
+created: 2026-07-07
+branch: claude/course-production
+---
+
+# Generate m18 L18B b04 quality check scene asset
+
+## Goal
+
+Generate one course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-18-lesson18B/m18_L18B_b04_quality-check.png`.
+
+## Scope
+
+- Use the supplied BMH course doodle references and cast-board character style.
+- Generate one 1600 x 900 PNG using the requested gpt-image-2 course image workflow.
+- Show a quality-check scene on a plain cornflower-blue field.
+- Place exactly two people total on the left or center: one BMH follow-up representative with headset and one manager.
+- Put a large blank outbound-message card on a simple review table.
+- Have the manager point gently at the blank card while the representative listens.
+- Include three small blank callout shapes above or beside the card.
+- Leave a clear empty circular pocket in the lower-right corner for Andrea's later corner-circle overlay.
+- Use thick wobbly black outlines, rounded simple shapes, flat fills only, and the locked palette: cornflower blue, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black.
+- Avoid clones, extra people, scolding posture, text, words, letters, numbers, labels, logos, app names, readable paperwork, ambient doodles, speech bubbles, thought bubbles, motion marks, random props, decorative clutter, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, and perspective.
+
+## Verification
+
+- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.
+- Confirm the file is a PNG at 1600 x 900.
+- Visually inspect for exactly two people, headset rep, manager pointing gently, blank card, three blank callouts, no text, no decorative clutter, and a clean lower-right pocket.

